      "content": "The Right to Repair is a crucial fight because it directly counters the \"right to fix and the right to own\" in the digital age, pushing back against planned and forced obsolescence. By demanding access to parts and diagnostic tools, it democratizes the right to maintain our own property, reducing the power of a few large corporations. This movement is essential for promoting a more sustainable and less monopolistic ecosystem for all consumers and independent repair shops.",
